  "bodyPreview": "Skip to Main Content\nThis website was built on Wix. Create yours today.\nGet Started\n\nM + M Cabinet Painting, LLC\n\nHome\n\nmmqpainting@gmail.com\n\n980-292-3250\n\nWelcome to\nM + M Cabinet Painting, LLC\nRequest a Quote\n\nPlease take a moment to fill out the form.\n\nFirst Name\nLast Name\nEmail\nSubject\nLeave us a message...\nSubmit\nProducts and Equipment\n\nYour kitchen deserves the best, and we spared no expense on our equipment and the products we use. The high-end sprayers and the authentic Italian Wood Coatings produce the finest finish. With these tools, and our system, your kitchen will last a lifetime!\n\nKitchen Cabinet Painting\nThe \"Experience\"\n\nThe process takes a week, some factors may change the duration. Day 1, we remove all the doors and drawers in your kitchen. Day 2-3, we work on them offsite in our shop. Day 4, we return to prep your kitchen for painting. Day 5, we return to clean up and hang the doors/drawers. Now it's time for you to enjoy your brand new kitchen!\n\nContact Us Today for a Free Quote!\nSubmit\n\n\"Max did a great job painting our kitchen. He literally transformed our room from a dark space to a bright inviting space. Very professional and timely. Would highly recommend his services.\"\n\nTom Maidenbauer\n\n\"Max was extremely easy to work with. He put a lot of work and attention to seal off the working area. The quality of the work is amazing. We love the results and highly recommend Max.\"\n\nLuis Ayala in Charlotte, NC \n\n\"The professional quality and standards that Max maintains throughout his work is indicative of someone who is passionate about their craft. We couldn’t be happier with our kitchen and eagerly recommend Max’s services to everyone we can\"\n\nShanon O\nRate Our Service\n\nHow Did We Do?\n\nWould you recommend us to your friends?\nYes\nNo\nSubmit\n\nM + M Cabinet Painting, LLC\n\nmmqpainting@gmail.com\n\n980-292-3250",
